## 🔧 Performance Monitoring Tools

### 1. React DevTools Profiler

```bash
# bash
# copy
# edit
# Install React DevTools
npm install -g react-devtools

# Connect to your app
react-devtools
```

### 2. Flipper for Debugging

```jsx
# jsx
# copy
# edit
// Add to your app entry point
import { addPlugin } from 'react-native-flipper';
import { NetworkPlugin } from 'react-native-flipper-network-plugin';

addPlugin(new NetworkPlugin());
```

### 3. Performance Monitoring with Firebase

```jsx
# jsx
# copy
# edit
// Initialize Firebase Performance
import perf from '@react-native-firebase/perf';

// Track screen render time
async function ProfileScreen() {
  const screenTrace = await perf().startScreenTrace('profile_screen');
  
  // Your component logic here
  
  // Stop the trace when component mounts
  useEffect(() => {
    return () => {
      screenTrace.stop();
    };
  }, []);
}
```

