## 🏆 Advanced Performance Techniques

### 1. Use Hermes JavaScript Engine

```json
# json
# copy
# edit
// In app.json for Expo
{
  "expo": {
    "jsEngine": "hermes"
  }
}

// In android/app/build.gradle for React Native CLI
project.ext.react = [
  enableHermes: true
]
```

### 2. Implement Virtualized Lists

```jsx
# jsx
# copy
# edit
import { VirtualizedList } from 'react-native';

<VirtualizedList
  data={data}
  getItem={(data, index) => data[index]}
  getItemCount={data => data.length}
  renderItem={({ item }) => <Item title={item.title} />}
  keyExtractor={item => item.id}
/>
```

### 3. Use InteractionManager for Heavy Tasks

```jsx
# jsx
# copy
# edit
import { InteractionManager } from 'react-native';

function ComponentWithHeavyTask() {
  const [data, setData] = useState(null);
  
  useEffect(() => {
    // Wait for animations to complete
    InteractionManager.runAfterInteractions(() => {
      // Run heavy task
      const result = performExpensiveCalculation();
      setData(result);
    });
  }, []);
  
  return (
    <View>
      {data ? <DataView data={data} /> : <LoadingIndicator />}
    </View>
  );
}
```

